<title>FINLAND: RAUTE SEES FULL-YEAR 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>RAUTE SEES FULL-YEAR 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Raute Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it now expected to post a full-year 1996 loss.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite Raute Wood's and Raute Precision business group's expected positive result and the restructuring carried out in North America Raute group will not reach a positive result in 1996,&quot; Raute said.</p>
<p>On June 4, Raute said full-year operating earnings were expected to improve on 1995.</p>
<p>In 1995, Raute reported a 1.1 million markka profit after financial items, down from 56.8 million in 1994.</p>
</text>
